<title>ALBANIA: Albania crude, gasoline output down in Q2.</title>
<headline>Albania crude, gasoline output down in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following energy output data Wednesday:</p>
<p> ALBANIA OIL OUTPUT		  Q2 1996     Q2 1995   Change</p>
<p> Crude oil (tonnes)		  123,039     132,000   -8,961</p>
<p> Natural gas (million cubic metres)    5.25		7   -1.749</p>
<p> Diesel (tonnes)		     22,717	  6,000  +16,717</p>
<p> Gasoline (tonnes)		    7,202	 28,900  -21,698</p>
<p> Kerosene (tonnes)		    3,540		0   +3,540</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
